# Known leaks outside WP-U3's scope (same on Windows): os_threads.c gives every guest thread and every guest fiber that
# runs a Ctx (new_ctx) that is never freed.
leak:new_ctx
# cxxrt_selftest.h (run by test_cxxrt as in the game): each section's Ctx (st_ctx, inlined into the sections at -O2, so
# matched by file) and the guard threads' Ctx are never freed, and st_guard does not close its thread handles. Self-test
# code, not the runtime; test_cxxrt's own EH-per-fiber and soak sections stay checked.
leak:cxxrt_selftest.h
